# Great Job! 🎉

So far, you can:

* Explore the major ideas students investigate throughout Thinking Critically About AI
* Identify how students develop more nuanced understandings of prompting, verification, privacy, and responsible AI use
* Examine instructional strategies that support questioning, evidence collection, and discussion
* Experience key lesson moments that help students build evidence-based judgments about AI systems

## Up Next

In the next section of this professional learning module, you will focus on the Generate and Judge Guide and how students build their final project across the unit.

